1
00:00:06,200 --> 00:00:08,360
=Episode 8=

2
00:00:08,399 --> 00:00:08,879
Miss.

3
00:00:09,200 --> 00:00:10,320
This is my home.

4
00:00:11,200 --> 00:00:11,679
Mother.

5
00:00:14,119 --> 00:00:14,480
Mother.

6
00:00:16,080 --> 00:00:17,000
Xiaoyan, you're back.

7
00:00:17,039 --> 00:00:17,359
Mm.

8
00:00:19,439 --> 00:00:20,199
And these two are?

9
00:00:20,519 --> 00:00:20,960
Mother.

10
00:00:21,599 --> 00:00:24,359
Niu Biao came to collect
the debt again today.

11
00:00:24,480 --> 00:00:24,920
Luckily,

12
00:00:24,920 --> 00:00:26,399
they saved me.

13
00:00:26,559 --> 00:00:27,760
You ran into Niu Biao?

14
00:00:28,120 --> 00:00:29,160
Were you hurt?

15
00:00:29,960 --> 00:00:31,239
They both have great Spiritual Power.

16
00:00:31,239 --> 00:00:32,440
I'm fine, Mother.

17
00:00:33,719 --> 00:00:34,879
Thank goodness.

18
00:00:35,359 --> 00:00:36,559
My sweet Xiaoyan.

19
00:00:38,920 --> 00:00:39,280
Here.

20
00:00:39,560 --> 00:00:40,240
Xiaoyan.

21
00:00:40,640 --> 00:00:42,079
It's your birthday today.

22
00:00:42,280 --> 00:00:43,320
Take this money

23
00:00:43,320 --> 00:00:45,119
and buy yourself some new clothes.

24
00:00:45,560 --> 00:00:46,600
When you come back,

25
00:00:46,799 --> 00:00:48,240
I'll make you birthday noodles.

26
00:00:48,280 --> 00:00:49,000
Thanks, mother.

27
00:00:49,399 --> 00:00:50,320
I'll go buy them tomorrow.

28
00:00:53,159 --> 00:00:55,479
(What use are you to this family?)

29
00:00:56,039 --> 00:00:57,320
(I've raised you all these years.)

30
00:00:57,359 --> 00:00:59,280
(Your food, clothes, everything...)

31
00:00:59,280 --> 00:01:01,159
(I paid for all of it.)

32
00:01:01,159 --> 00:01:02,719
(You refuse to go on blind dates)

33
00:01:02,719 --> 00:01:04,039
(or get married.)

34
00:01:04,039 --> 00:01:06,039
(What good is school for a girl?)

35
00:01:06,039 --> 00:01:07,520
(You're nothing but a burden.)

36
00:01:07,640 --> 00:01:10,480
(You're useless to this family.)

37
00:01:15,519 --> 00:01:16,120
Oh, look at me.

38
00:01:16,519 --> 00:01:17,680
I got carried away talking.

39
00:01:18,079 --> 00:01:19,519
Please, have a seat.

40
00:01:19,920 --> 00:01:20,719
Please sit.

41
00:01:21,480 --> 00:01:22,719
Xiaoyan asked us

42
00:01:22,799 --> 00:01:24,840
to examine you first.

43
00:01:26,280 --> 00:01:27,359
Mm.

44
00:01:47,120 --> 00:01:48,560
I feel much better now.

45
00:01:50,040 --> 00:01:51,840
We can only ease your pain for now.

46
00:01:51,840 --> 00:01:52,359
Mm.

47
00:01:52,359 --> 00:01:53,560
For further treatment,

48
00:01:53,799 --> 00:01:55,079
you'll need a proper physician.

49
00:01:55,519 --> 00:01:56,319
Mm.

50
00:01:57,319 --> 00:01:58,400
Thank you, sir.

51
00:01:58,400 --> 00:01:59,519
Thank you, miss.

52
00:02:00,719 --> 00:02:02,599
Get some rest.

53
00:02:02,599 --> 00:02:03,280
Mm.

54
00:02:03,280 --> 00:02:03,959
Thank you.

55
00:02:03,959 --> 00:02:05,400
- Thank you.
- Thank you.

56
00:02:06,400 --> 00:02:07,200
Mm.

57
00:02:08,680 --> 00:02:10,560
Mother, get some rest.

58
00:02:18,439 --> 00:02:19,360
By the way, sir,

59
00:02:19,360 --> 00:02:21,000
I still don't know your name.

60
00:02:22,120 --> 00:02:23,120
How careless of me.

61
00:02:23,599 --> 00:02:24,199
I'm...

62
00:02:24,439 --> 00:02:25,199
Chi Li.

63
00:02:25,400 --> 00:02:26,280
Chi Li.

64
00:02:27,400 --> 00:02:28,520
I'm Xi Yuan.

65
00:02:37,680 --> 00:02:39,639
I guess that makes us friends.

66
00:02:45,879 --> 00:02:46,759
Friends?

67
00:02:49,280 --> 00:02:50,080
Xi Yuan.

68
00:02:51,199 --> 00:02:53,879
I want us to be more than friends.

69
00:02:54,039 --> 00:02:55,039
Sir, Miss.

70
00:02:58,560 --> 00:03:00,080
I made these lanterns myself.

71
00:03:00,319 --> 00:03:01,800
If you don't mind,

72
00:03:02,000 --> 00:03:03,680
please accept these two lanterns.

73
00:03:04,879 --> 00:03:06,280
They're my way of thanking you.

74
00:03:08,639 --> 00:03:10,439
This is beautiful!

75
00:03:12,639 --> 00:03:14,319
Did you make all the lanterns

76
00:03:14,319 --> 00:03:15,240
in the courtyard too?

77
00:03:16,199 --> 00:03:18,759
Mother's treatment costs
a lot of Spirit Stones.

78
00:03:19,319 --> 00:03:22,120
I need to make more lanterns
for the Qixi Festival

79
00:03:22,360 --> 00:03:24,000
and sell them at the market.

80
00:03:26,240 --> 00:03:26,879
How about this?

81
00:03:27,680 --> 00:03:29,280
Teach us how to make them.

82
00:03:29,319 --> 00:03:30,960
Then we can help you earn money
for your mother's treatment.

83
00:03:33,439 --> 00:03:34,240
But...

84
00:03:34,240 --> 00:03:35,360
I still have something to do.

85
00:03:35,360 --> 00:03:37,080
I probably need to...

86
00:03:38,680 --> 00:03:40,680
We haven't had time
to get to know each other yet.

87
00:03:41,560 --> 00:03:42,360
Besides,

88
00:03:42,879 --> 00:03:44,800
Xiaoyan still has many lanterns
left to make.

89
00:03:45,520 --> 00:03:46,919
Why don't we help her?

90
00:03:47,120 --> 00:03:48,039
Wouldn't that be nice?

91
00:03:51,120 --> 00:03:52,439
Please, miss!

92
00:03:52,439 --> 00:03:54,199
Please help me.

93
00:03:54,800 --> 00:03:58,280
I can't make that many by myself.

94
00:03:58,879 --> 00:03:59,919
Miss?

95
00:04:00,879 --> 00:04:01,639
Miss?

96
00:04:02,560 --> 00:04:03,400
All right.

97
00:04:03,639 --> 00:04:04,639
Great!

98
00:04:18,280 --> 00:04:18,759
Xi Yuan.

99
00:04:20,319 --> 00:04:22,959
Is there someone you like?

100
00:04:23,439 --> 00:04:24,680
Someone I like?

101
00:04:25,160 --> 00:04:25,839
What do you think

102
00:04:26,199 --> 00:04:27,040
of me?

103
00:04:27,360 --> 00:04:27,680
Huh?

104
00:04:27,680 --> 00:04:28,480
Not much.

105
00:04:30,319 --> 00:04:31,120
Jin Yunlie.

106
00:04:33,040 --> 00:04:33,959
Why are you with him?

107
00:04:34,560 --> 00:04:35,079
I...

108
00:04:35,360 --> 00:04:36,000
What?

109
00:04:36,680 --> 00:04:37,519
Is that a problem?

110
00:04:37,879 --> 00:04:39,279
You entered Huyun's territory.

111
00:04:39,800 --> 00:04:40,839
Did I give you permission for that?

112
00:04:40,839 --> 00:04:42,199
Permission or not,

113
00:04:43,079 --> 00:04:44,199
the king's already here.

114
00:04:44,720 --> 00:04:45,519
King?

115
00:04:46,279 --> 00:04:47,120
What king?

116
00:04:51,439 --> 00:04:52,680
The King of Huangyan.

117
00:04:53,120 --> 00:04:54,240
Stay away from him.

118
00:04:54,800 --> 00:04:55,439
What?

119
00:04:56,879 --> 00:04:58,399
Is the mighty King of Huangyan

120
00:04:58,759 --> 00:05:01,319
openly trying to take someone
by force in Huyun?

121
00:05:02,000 --> 00:05:02,759
What if I do?

122
00:05:02,879 --> 00:05:03,839
Then let's see

123
00:05:04,319 --> 00:05:05,519
if you have the ability.

124
00:05:08,240 --> 00:05:10,040
(Why is Chi Li causing trouble?)

125
00:05:10,639 --> 00:05:11,480
(Is he planning to take Xi Yuan
back to Huangyan?)

126
00:05:11,480 --> 00:05:12,120
Wait.

127
00:05:12,279 --> 00:05:14,600
Can you two tell me something first...

128
00:05:14,600 --> 00:05:16,839
Do you know each other?

129
00:05:16,839 --> 00:05:18,000
(In your dreams.)

130
00:05:19,000 --> 00:05:20,000
- No.
- No.

131
00:05:22,839 --> 00:05:24,240
(Why does this feel like)

132
00:05:24,240 --> 00:05:25,600
(a clash of kings?)

133
00:05:31,120 --> 00:05:32,160
You two carry on.

134
00:05:33,199 --> 00:05:33,639
I'll...

135
00:05:33,639 --> 00:05:34,439
take a break.

136
00:05:34,879 --> 00:05:35,839
Miss! Miss!

137
00:05:35,839 --> 00:05:36,519
Come over here.

138
00:05:36,920 --> 00:05:38,079
What's wrong with those two?

139
00:05:38,079 --> 00:05:38,879
What's going on?

140
00:05:42,519 --> 00:05:43,319
Are you okay?

141
00:05:43,360 --> 00:05:44,360
Why are you here?

142
00:05:44,439 --> 00:05:45,000
You went missing.

143
00:05:45,680 --> 00:05:46,800
Of course I came looking for you.

144
00:05:47,240 --> 00:05:47,959
I was worried.

145
00:05:49,120 --> 00:05:50,920
You can't just say you were worried.

146
00:05:51,560 --> 00:05:53,680
When Qing Yuluo abducted her,

147
00:05:54,480 --> 00:05:55,279
where were you?

148
00:05:55,800 --> 00:05:56,800
Enough.

149
00:05:57,079 --> 00:05:58,240
Just drop it.

150
00:05:59,879 --> 00:06:00,959
You...

151
00:06:01,000 --> 00:06:02,639
I'm standing up for you.

152
00:06:02,959 --> 00:06:04,439
Why are you taking his side?

153
00:06:04,839 --> 00:06:06,040
Would your family approve?

154
00:06:07,120 --> 00:06:07,839
My family?

155
00:06:08,240 --> 00:06:09,759
I don't have any family.

156
00:06:09,759 --> 00:06:11,839
I've always been on my own.

157
00:06:12,319 --> 00:06:13,480
When Xi Yuan went missing,

158
00:06:13,800 --> 00:06:16,360
I used the Whispering Bell at once.

159
00:06:16,439 --> 00:06:18,079
But someone had placed a restriction
on the Whispering Bell.

160
00:06:18,360 --> 00:06:19,040
Tell me.

161
00:06:20,160 --> 00:06:22,319
Did you stop me from finding her
on purpose?

162
00:06:24,000 --> 00:06:24,800
Miss.

163
00:06:25,439 --> 00:06:27,199
Those two men

164
00:06:27,480 --> 00:06:29,399
both seem interested in you.

165
00:06:30,279 --> 00:06:31,879
Don't say things like that.

166
00:06:32,160 --> 00:06:32,920
Um...

167
00:06:33,199 --> 00:06:34,639
Don't we still have lanterns to finish?

168
00:06:34,800 --> 00:06:36,000
Let's keep working.

169
00:06:36,199 --> 00:06:36,920
Okay.

170
00:06:36,920 --> 00:06:37,639
Come on.

171
00:06:38,199 --> 00:06:38,920
Okay.

172
00:06:38,920 --> 00:06:39,920
- I'm coming too.
- I'm coming too.

173
00:06:44,959 --> 00:06:46,600
Why does this feel a little...

174
00:06:46,800 --> 00:06:47,439
Hmm.

175
00:06:47,439 --> 00:06:48,279
Let me see.

176
00:06:56,160 --> 00:06:57,120
Draw this.

177
00:06:57,120 --> 00:06:57,879
Sure.

178
00:06:58,399 --> 00:06:59,199
That works.

179
00:06:59,920 --> 00:07:01,000
Draw it like this.

180
00:07:35,360 --> 00:07:37,600
(Don't even think of taking Xi Yuan
away from me.)

181
00:07:37,839 --> 00:07:38,879
(She's my sister,)

182
00:07:39,079 --> 00:07:40,480
(I'll take her if I want.)

183
00:07:45,680 --> 00:07:46,319
Seriously?

184
00:07:46,560 --> 00:07:47,560
Not again.

185
00:07:55,959 --> 00:07:56,519
Xi Yuan.

186
00:07:56,519 --> 00:07:57,399
I'm done.

187
00:07:58,079 --> 00:07:58,920
So am I.

188
00:07:59,600 --> 00:08:00,079
Xi Yuan.

189
00:08:00,079 --> 00:08:00,319
Look.

190
00:08:00,759 --> 00:08:01,759
Look at mine first.

191
00:08:02,199 --> 00:08:03,360
No, mine first.

192
00:08:06,759 --> 00:08:07,759
This one's not bad.

193
00:08:08,600 --> 00:08:10,560
Those two are ugly.

194
00:08:13,839 --> 00:08:14,920
Hand me that one.

195
00:08:15,480 --> 00:08:16,079
Okay.

196
00:08:25,879 --> 00:08:26,680
I'll carry it for you.

197
00:08:42,320 --> 00:08:43,000
Xiaoyan.

198
00:08:43,000 --> 00:08:44,720
Once we sell these lanterns,

199
00:08:44,840 --> 00:08:47,159
we can afford your mother's treatment.

200
00:08:47,320 --> 00:08:48,120
Mm.

201
00:08:48,960 --> 00:08:50,639
Three, two, one!

202
00:08:50,639 --> 00:08:52,519
- Lanterns for sale!
- Lanterns for sale!

203
00:08:54,600 --> 00:08:55,440
Look at this one.

204
00:08:55,440 --> 00:08:56,440
This one is beautiful.

205
00:08:56,440 --> 00:08:57,360
It's shaped like a rabbit.

206
00:08:57,440 --> 00:08:58,480
How about this one?

207
00:08:58,480 --> 00:08:59,600
This one's nice too.

208
00:08:59,799 --> 00:09:00,559
I'll take this one.

209
00:09:00,759 --> 00:09:01,759
Thanks. Take care!

210
00:09:02,559 --> 00:09:04,360
Lanterns for sale!

211
00:09:04,360 --> 00:09:05,559
Lanterns for sale!

212
00:09:05,759 --> 00:09:08,240
Come take a look!

213
00:09:09,519 --> 00:09:10,399
Brother.

214
00:09:17,879 --> 00:09:18,879
Brother.

215
00:09:25,600 --> 00:09:26,519
(She's not like her after all.)

216
00:09:31,240 --> 00:09:32,519
Lanterns for sale!

217
00:09:32,519 --> 00:09:33,159
Xi Yuan

218
00:09:34,039 --> 00:09:35,279
is Huangyan's princess, isn't she?

219
00:09:35,639 --> 00:09:36,679
So you know.

220
00:09:38,519 --> 00:09:39,799
Thanks to you.

221
00:09:39,960 --> 00:09:41,200
Lanterns for sale!

222
00:09:41,600 --> 00:09:42,480
Then you should know

223
00:09:43,440 --> 00:09:44,440
her identity

224
00:09:45,320 --> 00:09:46,919
puts her in danger in Huyun.

225
00:09:49,039 --> 00:09:49,840
I heard

226
00:09:50,320 --> 00:09:51,559
she won the Martial Trial

227
00:09:52,399 --> 00:09:53,759
and will become your Crown Princess.

228
00:09:54,320 --> 00:09:56,759
What right do you have
to worry about her safety?

229
00:09:57,279 --> 00:10:00,159
It was Huangyan itself
that abandoned her.

230
00:10:01,080 --> 00:10:01,879
Her safety

231
00:10:03,000 --> 00:10:04,399
is no concern of yours.

232
00:10:05,120 --> 00:10:05,720
From now on,

233
00:10:06,240 --> 00:10:07,559
I'll be the one protecting her.

234
00:10:08,600 --> 00:10:10,279
I'm sorry for what happened

235
00:10:10,679 --> 00:10:11,559
to her in the past.

236
00:10:17,519 --> 00:10:19,240
Sister, what are you doing?

237
00:10:24,360 --> 00:10:25,399
This guard

238
00:10:25,600 --> 00:10:27,559
dared insult you behind your back.

239
00:10:28,399 --> 00:10:29,600
So I killed him

240
00:10:30,039 --> 00:10:32,279
and silenced him forever.

241
00:10:32,639 --> 00:10:34,120
According to Huangyan tradition,

242
00:10:34,600 --> 00:10:36,039
the more unusual someone's wing color,

243
00:10:36,399 --> 00:10:37,919
the greater their power.

244
00:10:39,679 --> 00:10:41,320
Huangyan royals

245
00:10:42,080 --> 00:10:43,279
all have black-and-red wings.

246
00:10:44,879 --> 00:10:45,759
But when my sister's

247
00:10:45,759 --> 00:10:47,720
Spiritual Power fully awakened,

248
00:10:47,919 --> 00:10:50,000
she grew a pair of pure white wings.

249
00:10:52,120 --> 00:10:52,919
Legend says

250
00:10:53,559 --> 00:10:55,960
only those with the greatest
Spiritual Power can possess such wings.

251
00:10:56,480 --> 00:10:58,679
But they were also an omen of disaster.

252
00:10:59,320 --> 00:11:01,320
All of Huangyan was shaken.

253
00:11:02,399 --> 00:11:04,840
Everyone thought she should
rule Huangyan.

254
00:11:05,919 --> 00:11:08,039
But Huangyan has only had male kings.

255
00:11:09,159 --> 00:11:10,159
She was a woman

256
00:11:10,840 --> 00:11:11,919
with white wings.

257
00:11:12,840 --> 00:11:14,039
She was violent

258
00:11:14,039 --> 00:11:15,000
and she loved killing.

259
00:11:15,799 --> 00:11:16,720
Everyone believed

260
00:11:17,799 --> 00:11:19,080
that if she became king,

261
00:11:20,320 --> 00:11:22,200
Huangyan would fall.

262
00:11:24,360 --> 00:11:26,080
Yet in the past thousand years,

263
00:11:26,080 --> 00:11:27,879
she was the only one in Huangyan
to awaken white wings.

264
00:11:28,679 --> 00:11:30,279
If Huangyan couldn't make use of her...

265
00:11:30,840 --> 00:11:33,279
Then no other kingdom could either.

266
00:11:35,200 --> 00:11:36,679
So Huangyan

267
00:11:37,399 --> 00:11:41,159
couldn't let such a powerful weapon

268
00:11:41,480 --> 00:11:42,480
fall into another kingdom's hands.

269
00:11:42,960 --> 00:11:44,200
Even you, her brother,

270
00:11:44,600 --> 00:11:45,320
believed that.

271
00:11:45,679 --> 00:11:46,279
Didn't you?

272
00:11:47,399 --> 00:11:48,639
She was unruly by nature.

273
00:11:48,639 --> 00:11:49,519
Lanterns for sale!

274
00:11:49,519 --> 00:11:50,480
But I didn't want her dead.

275
00:11:50,480 --> 00:11:51,360
Lanterns for sale!

276
00:11:51,360 --> 00:11:53,440
Unfortunately, the others
in Huangyan didn't see it that way.

277
00:11:54,840 --> 00:11:55,919
I couldn't protect her.

278
00:11:56,159 --> 00:11:57,240
So I sealed her Spiritual Power

279
00:11:57,639 --> 00:11:58,840
and sent her away from Huangyan.

280
00:12:01,759 --> 00:12:02,559
Jin Yunlie.

281
00:12:03,480 --> 00:12:05,000
If you can truly keep her safe,

282
00:12:05,399 --> 00:12:08,080
then I suppose I owe you one.

283
00:12:09,440 --> 00:12:10,720
What do you mean, "suppose"?

284
00:12:12,360 --> 00:12:13,960
That's the best you're getting.

285
00:12:14,240 --> 00:12:16,519
There are many things that are

286
00:12:17,360 --> 00:12:19,279
far more complicated than you think.

287
00:12:25,440 --> 00:12:27,320
(The body is still Yuan's.)

288
00:12:28,519 --> 00:12:30,120
(But the soul inside...)

289
00:12:31,679 --> 00:12:32,840
(Who is she really?)

290
00:12:36,200 --> 00:12:38,120
Lanterns for sale!

291
00:12:39,080 --> 00:12:39,799
Set them out neatly.

292
00:12:49,840 --> 00:12:51,000
You like her,

293
